+//! These tests pin the concurrency invariants from
+//! `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md`
+//! `### 3. Event Log`, `### 6. Consolidation Engine`, and
+//! `### Phase 11: Hardening`.
